  <data name="ActionQuery_DESCRIPTION" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The ActionQuery functoid is used to execute a stored procedure and return a single value as an OUT parameter.
The functoid requires the following input parameters in this order: 
	1) the connection-string key,
	2) Procedure to execute
	3) Name of return parameter (only one return parameter possible).
	Must be of type varchar with max size of 8000
	4*)[a @column name, lookup value] or [sp @parameter, parameter value]. 
    	The functoid can take a maximum of 6 pairs of  [sp psarameter, parameter value].</value>
  </data>
